qx|A2|st||rh||ah|Board 2 IMPs   -   June 12, 2024|pn|hondo717,aspiring,marikaSz,coxenrider|
md|4SKQJT8HQJD96CA764,S32HT98764DK73CT2,S95HA2DAQ42CKQJ98,SA764HK53DJT85C53|sv|n|
mb|P|mb|1S|mb|P|mb|2C|mb|P|mb|3C|mb|P|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North has a very nice hand. After I bid 3@C the hand has 16 HCP, 1 length point, 1 quality suit point, 1 point for 2 doubletons, and 1 point for side 4 card suit for 20 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at|. That is enough for us to be in slam if we have all suits controlled plus enough key cards.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 22 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So let us bid our hand the way I would bid it if playing with a regular partner. The hand is strong enough to bid RKCB right away. Since I bid spades, it is very likely I have spades controlled and North has all the other suits controlled. And I like to play what is known as |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=kickback,Kickback^*N|CP||FP||at| RKCB where the suit one above the trump suit at the 4 level is RKCB.|
PG| ***** 23 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|By playing |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=kickback,Kickback^*N|CP||FP||at| RKCB, North can bid 4@D as RKCB.|
PG| ***** 24 ***** |


mb|4D|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|4S|an|1 key card|
PG| ***** 25 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The responses are  1st step (4@H) is 0 or 3, 2nd step (4@S) is 1 or 4, and so on missing only one key card and holding the trump queen.|
PG| ***** 26 ***** |


mb|P|mb|?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|lb|*bBid for North.^^6C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North can and should bid 6@C. In general, whenever you bid RKCB you should bid 6 if you hold all the key cards or if you hold 4 key cards and the trump queen.|
PG| ***** 28 ***** |


mb|6C|mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|
pg| ***** 29 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|
