%%%%%%Hand 3
https://tinyurl.com/25rbfuu2
qx|A3|st||rh||ah|Board 3 IMPs   -   June 12, 2024|pn|hondo717,marikaSz,aspiring,coxenrider|
md|1SQ87432HA9D9C9754,SAKJ965HQ865D7C82,SHKJ742DAKQ83CAJT,STHT3DJT6542CKQ63|sv|e|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Many would not open 2@S with my weak suit. However, a 6-4 distribution and favorable vulnerability meaning we are not vulnerable and they are tell me this hand definitely should be opened 2@S.|
PG| ***** 40 ***** |


mb|2S|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|MB|3d|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Unfortunately I preempted partner. 2@S is not what partner wants to hear. It is not clear what partner should do. 3@D bid really doesn't accomplish anything. Assuming new suits are forcing, if I were North, I would bid 3@H, hoping that partner can raise to 4@H and if partner rebids 3@S, I would bid 3N.|
PG| ***** 41 ***** |


