UP|52|nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BA Kib: ^*nWhat would West bid had South bid 1@S instead of double?|
PG| ***** 73 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West would make a |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=negativedoubles,Negative Double^*N|CP||FP||at| which is essentially the legal way for West to bid 1@H. Then East/West basically have the same auction.|
PG| ***** 74 ***** |


