mb|1D|mb|P|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I don't mind pass by East as probably most players will pass too. But you can overcall at the 1 level with as little as 8 points. I don't love the heart suit and it is not clear you want partner to lead it. But I do like to compete, so I might very well bid 1@H with East hand.|
